context FamilyRegister
inv HasFamilies:
self.families->notEmpty()

context Family
inv HasName:
self.name <> ''

context Family
inv HasFather:
self.father->notEmpty()

context Family
inv ChildrenHaveNames:
self.sons->forAll(s | s.name <> '') and
self.daughters->forAll(d | d.name <> '')



context FamilyMember
inv MappedToPerson:
self.person->notEmpty()

context Person
inv FullNamePresent:
self.fullName <> ''

context Male
inv MaleHasFullName:
self.fullName <> ''


Invariant kiểm tra logic transform mức đơn giản
Nếu correspondence/model của bạn đã materialize relation giữa source và target:

context FamilyMember
inv MappedToPerson:
self.person->notEmpty()

context FamilyMember
inv ExactlyOneTargetPerson:
self.person->size() = 1

context FamilyMember
inv TargetFullNameContainsSourceName:
self.person->forAll(p | p.fullName.includes(self.name))


2. Kiểm tra cả Families -> Persons sau transform

Lưu ý: bộ này giả định hệ của bạn đã materialize được quan hệ từ FamilyMember sang Person qua navigation person.

context FamilyRegister
inv HasFamilies:
self.families->notEmpty()

context Family
inv HasName:
self.name <> ''

context Family
inv HasFather:
self.father->notEmpty()

context Family
inv ChildrenHaveNames:
self.sons->forAll(s | s.name <> '') and
self.daughters->forAll(d | d.name <> '')

context FamilyMember
inv MappedToPerson:
self.person->notEmpty()

context FamilyMember
inv ExactlyOneMappedPerson:
self.person->size() = 1

context Person
inv PersonNameNotEmpty:
self.name <> ''

context FamilyMember
inv TargetNameContainsSourceName:
self.person->forAll(p | p.name.includes(self.name))

context Family
inv FatherMappedCorrectly:
self.father->notEmpty() implies
self.father.person->forAll(p | p.name = self.name + ', ' + self.father.name)

context Family
inv MotherMappedCorrectly:
self.mother->notEmpty() implies
self.mother.person->forAll(p | p.name = self.name + ', ' + self.mother.name)

context Family
inv SonsMappedCorrectly:
self.sons->forAll(s |
    s.person->forAll(p | p.name = self.name + ', ' + s.name)
)

context Family
inv DaughtersMappedCorrectly:
self.daughters->forAll(d |
    d.person->forAll(p | p.name = self.name + ', ' + d.name)
)